---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<style>
  .book-strip { background: var(--night-3); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 10px 0; }
  .book-strip-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; }
  .book-strip a { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(238,241,246,0.75); }
  .book-strip a:hover { color: var(--offwh); }
  .book-strip strong { color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }
  .book-strip-link { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; white-space: nowrap; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .book-strip { padding: 8px 0; }
    .book-strip a { font-size: 12px; }
  }
</style>

<Layout title="Free AI Diagnosis for SMBs · ERA 1 to ERA 3 · 3GI" description="ERA 1: Operational chaos. ERA 2: Unused data. ERA 3: AI working for you. We move companies from one ERA to the next. Identify what to automate with highest ROI in 3 weeks. Free ERA Test from 5 minutes." lang="en">
  <div class="book-strip" style="margin-top: 68px;">
    <div class="container book-strip-inner">
      <a href="/en/inteligencia-organizacional" class="book-strip-link">📖 New book: <strong>Organizational Intelligence in the AI Era</strong>, by Gonzalo Gompertz →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- HERO -->
<section id="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-tag" data-i18n="hero-tag">AI Diagnosis for SMEs · Chile & LATAM</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title" data-i18n="hero-title">How much is your company losing<br> by not using AI this month?<br> <em>You don't know. That's the problem.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub" data-i18n="hero-sub">Most SMEs lose between USD 30,000 and 150,000 per year in processes that could already be automated. In 3 weeks we identify exactly which ones are yours — and deliver the concrete roadmap to fix them.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="/test-era" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
        <span data-i18n="hero-btn-calendar">Take the free ERA Test</span>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/56988974898?text=Hola,%20me%20interesa%20conocer%20más%20sobre%20el%20diagnóstico%20de%20IA" target="_blank" class="btn btn-whatsapp btn-lg" aria-label="Escribir por WhatsApp">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
        <span data-i18n="hero-btn-wa">Write on WhatsApp</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-proof">
      <div class="proof-item">
        <div class="proof-num">3</div>
        <div class="proof-label" data-i18n="proof-1">weeks of diagnosis</div>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-divider"></div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <div class="proof-num">263%</div>
        <div class="proof-label" data-i18n="proof-2">documented ROI · real case Chile</div>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-divider"></div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <div class="proof-num">$250k</div>
        <div class="proof-label" data-i18n="proof-3">recovered in lost billing</div>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-divider"></div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <div class="proof-num">6</div>
        <div class="proof-label" data-i18n="proof-4">structured methodology phases</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- DOLOR -->
<section id="dolor" class="section-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag" data-i18n="dolor-tag">Does this sound familiar?</div>
    <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="dolor-title">The problem isn't AI.<br>It's knowing where to start.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub" data-i18n="dolor-sub">Most SMEs have the potential to automate with AI — but don't have the ERA Test to do it right.</p>
    <div class="pain-grid">
      <div class="pain-card fade-up">
        <div class="pain-icon">💸</div>
        <div class="pain-title" data-i18n="pain1-title">You bought tools your team doesn't use</div>
        <div class="pain-desc" data-i18n="pain1-desc">Unadopted CRMs, BI nobody checks, unused licenses. The investment was made. The results never came.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card fade-up">
        <div class="pain-icon">🔍</div>
        <div class="pain-title" data-i18n="pain2-title">You know there are inefficiencies but not what they cost</div>
        <div class="pain-desc" data-i18n="pain2-desc">The team loses hours on administrative tasks. Reports take days. You know it happens. You don't know what fixing it is worth.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card fade-up">
        <div class="pain-icon">🎯</div>
        <div class="pain-title" data-i18n="pain3-title">You don't want to invest in the wrong solution</div>
        <div class="pain-desc" data-i18n="pain3-desc">Implementing AI without a diagnosis is guesswork. Companies that fail at digital transformation don't fail because of technology — they fail by implementing without understanding the problem first.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ERAS -->
<section id="eras" class="section-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:20px;">
      <div class="section-tag" data-i18n="eras-tag">The starting point</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="eras-title">What ERA is<br>your company in?</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px; font-weight:300; color:rgba(238,241,246,0.6); line-height:1.7; margin-top:16px; max-width:600px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;" data-i18n="eras-sub">Before implementing any AI solution, you have to know where you stand. Our ERA Test measures your company across two dimensions — operational and commercial — and defines the path forward.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Tarjetas ERA (solo móvil ≤640px) -->
    <div class="era-mobile-cards">
      <div class="emc emc-e1">
        <div class="emc-header">
          <span class="emc-icon">🔥</span>
          <div><div class="emc-badge">ERA 1</div><div class="emc-name">Operational Chaos</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="emc-rows">
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Decisions</div><div class="emc-val">By gut feeling and the owner's experience</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Operations</div><div class="emc-val">Manual. Depends on key people</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Information</div><div class="emc-val">In emails, Excel, or someone's memory</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Time</div><div class="emc-val">Firefighting, day to day</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">To grow</div><div class="emc-val">You have to hire more people</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="emc emc-e2">
        <div class="emc-header">
          <span class="emc-icon">📊</span>
          <div><div class="emc-badge">ERA 2</div><div class="emc-name">Organized Data</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="emc-rows">
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Decisions</div><div class="emc-val">With historical data, manual analysis</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Operations</div><div class="emc-val">Partial. Some tasks automated</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Information</div><div class="emc-val">In systems, but in disconnected silos</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Time</div><div class="emc-val">Management and manual reports</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">To grow</div><div class="emc-val">Limited by manual processes</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="emc emc-e3">
        <div class="emc-header">
          <span class="emc-icon">⚡</span>
          <div><div class="emc-badge">ERA 3</div><div class="emc-name">AI-Powered Business</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="emc-rows">
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Decisions</div><div class="emc-val">With data + AI that anticipates scenarios</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Operations</div><div class="emc-val">Automatic flows. AI executes without intervention</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Information</div><div class="emc-val">Centralized, connected, and real-time</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">Time</div><div class="emc-val">Strategy, clients, and growth</div></div>
          <div class="emc-row"><div class="emc-dim">To grow</div><div class="emc-val">AI absorbs the volume without adding costs</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:rgba(0,232,145,0.07);border:1px solid rgba(0,232,145,0.18);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;">
        <div>
          <div class="efg-cta-text">We move your company to ERA 3</div>
          <div class="efg-cta-sub"><a href="/metodologia#espectro" style="color:rgba(0,232,145,0.5);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;">Each ERA has 3 precision positions → see full spectrum</a></div>
        </div>
        <a href="/test-era" class="btn btn-primary">Discover my ERA now — from 5 min →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid ERA (desktop) -->
    <div class="era-scroll-wrap"><div class="era-framework-grid">
      <!-- Cabecera -->
      <div class="efg-dim-header"><span>Dimension</span></div>
      <div class="efg-era-header efg-h1">
        <div class="efg-badge">ERA 1</div>
        <div class="efg-icon">🔥</div>
        <div class="efg-name" data-i18n="era1-name">Operational Chaos</div>
        <div class="efg-pills">
          <span class="efg-pill">Decisions by gut feeling</span>
          <span class="efg-pill">No data</span>
          <span class="efg-pill">Everything depends on you</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="efg-era-header efg-h2">
        <div class="efg-badge">ERA 2</div>
        <div class="efg-icon">📊</div>
        <div class="efg-name" data-i18n="era2-name">Organized Data</div>
        <div class="efg-pills">
          <span class="efg-pill">Systems exist</span>
          <span class="efg-pill">Data in silos</span>
          <span class="efg-pill">Manual reports</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="efg-era-header efg-h3">
        <div class="efg-badge">ERA 3</div>
        <div class="efg-icon">⚡</div>
        <div class="efg-name" data-i18n="era3-name">AI-Powered Business</div>
        <div class="efg-pills">
          <span class="efg-pill">AI handles the volume</span>
          <span class="efg-pill">Real-time decisions</span>
          <span class="efg-pill">You in the strategy</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fila: Decisiones -->
      <div class="efg-dim"><span data-i18n="efg-dim1">Decisions</span></div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c1" data-i18n="efg-d1-e1">By gut feeling and the owner's experience</div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c2" data-i18n="efg-d1-e2">With historical data, manual analysis</div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c3" data-i18n="efg-d1-e3">With data + AI that anticipates scenarios</div>

      <!-- Fila: Operación -->
      <div class="efg-dim"><span data-i18n="efg-dim2">Operations</span></div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c1" data-i18n="efg-d2-e1">Manual. Depends on key people</div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c2" data-i18n="efg-d2-e2">Partial. Some tasks automated</div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c3" data-i18n="efg-d2-e3">Automatic flows. AI executes without intervention</div>

      <!-- Fila: Información -->
      <div class="efg-dim"><span data-i18n="efg-dim3">Information</span></div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c1" data-i18n="efg-d3-e1">In emails, Excel, or someone's memory</div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c2" data-i18n="efg-d3-e2">In systems, but in disconnected silos</div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c3" data-i18n="efg-d3-e3">Centralized, connected, and real-time</div>

      <!-- Fila: Tiempo del dueño -->
      <div class="efg-dim"><span data-i18n="efg-dim4">Owner's time</span></div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c1" data-i18n="efg-d4-e1">Firefighting, day to day</div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c2" data-i18n="efg-d4-e2">Management and manual reports</div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c3" data-i18n="efg-d4-e3">Strategy, clients, and growth</div>

      <!-- Fila: Para crecer -->
      <div class="efg-dim efg-last"><span data-i18n="efg-dim5">To grow</span></div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c1 efg-last" data-i18n="efg-d5-e1">You have to hire more people</div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c2 efg-last" data-i18n="efg-d5-e2">Limited by manual processes</div>
      <div class="efg-cell efg-c3 efg-last" data-i18n="efg-d5-e3">AI absorbs the volume without adding costs</div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="efg-cta-row">
        <div>
          <div class="efg-cta-text" data-i18n="eras-caption">We take your company to ERA 3</div>
          <div class="efg-cta-sub" data-i18n="eras-precision"><a href="/metodologia#espectro" style="color:rgba(0,232,145,0.5); text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:3px;" data-i18n="eras-precision-link">Each ERA has 3 precision positions → see the full spectrum</a></div>
        </div>
        <a href="/test-era" class="btn btn-primary" data-i18n="eras-cta">Discover my ERA now — from 5 min →</a>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- POR QUÉ 3GI -->
<section id="por-que-3gi" class="section-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag">Why 3G Intelligence</div>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:12px;">We're not an AI agency.<br>We're consultants who understand your business.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom:20px;">The difference is the ERA Test. Before proposing any tool, we understand how your company operates — and whether AI really has a return there.</p>
    <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr)); gap:20px; margin-bottom:20px;">
      <div style="background:var(--night-3); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; padding:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:28px; margin-bottom:12px;">🏭</div>
        <div style="font-family:Syne,sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:15px; margin-bottom:8px;">20+ years in mid-sized companies</div>
        <div style="font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.6;">Sales, operations, ERP, teams. We understand the business before talking technology — something few AI consultants have.</div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--night-3); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; padding:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:28px; margin-bottom:12px;">📐</div>
        <div style="font-family:Syne,sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:15px; margin-bottom:8px;">Proprietary, registered methodology</div>
        <div style="font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.6;">The 3 ERAs Framework is registered as intellectual property. It's not a generic process — it's a methodology built for the real context of Latin American SMEs.</div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--night-3); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; padding:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:28px; margin-bottom:12px;">📊</div>
        <div style="font-family:Syne,sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:15px; margin-bottom:8px;">ROI-first, always</div>
        <div style="font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.6;">If the ERA Test shows there's no real return, we tell you. We don't implement for the sake of it. Every initiative carries a number before it's approved.</div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--night-3); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; padding:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:28px; margin-bottom:12px;">🌎</div>
        <div style="font-family:Syne,sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:15px; margin-bottom:8px;">Built for LATAM</div>
        <div style="font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.6;">Data informality, small teams, tight budgets. We design solutions that work in the real-world context of Latin American companies — not adaptations of U.S. case studies.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; padding:20px 24px; background:rgba(0,232,145,0.04); border:1px solid rgba(0,232,145,0.15); border-radius:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div style="flex:1; min-width:200px;">
        <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--green); margin-bottom:4px;">Founder & Director</div>
        <div style="font-family:Syne,sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:15px; margin-bottom:4px;">Gonzalo Gompertz G.</div>
        <div style="font-size:14px; color:var(--muted);">MBA · 20+ years with SMEs in Chile & LATAM · AI operational transformation specialist</div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gonzalo-gompertz-geldres" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:10px 20px; background:rgba(0,232,145,0.1); border:1px solid rgba(0,232,145,0.3); border-radius:8px; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:var(--green); white-space:nowrap; transition:all .2s;">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
        View LinkedIn profile
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTORES -->
<section id="sectores" class="section-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag" data-i18n="sect-tag">Do you recognize yourself here?</div>
    <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="sect-title">The problem has a face.<br>Depending on your sector.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub" data-i18n="sect-sub">Not all inefficiencies look the same. These are the situations we see most — and what changes when they're solved.</p>
    <div class="sect-grid">

      <div class="sect-card fade-up">
        <div class="sect-sector" data-i18n="sect1-sector">Inspections · Certifications</div>
        <div>
          <div class="sect-before-tag" data-i18n="sect-before-tag">Today</div>
          <p class="sect-txt sect-txt-before" data-i18n="sect1-before">Every file moves by email and WhatsApp. The inspector arrives on-site not knowing if the client paid. The manager finds unbilled work weeks later.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sect-divider"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="sect-after-tag" data-i18n="sect-after-tag">With 3GI</div>
          <p class="sect-txt sect-txt-after" data-i18n="sect1-after">Full visibility of all files. Automatic billing alerts. $250k recovered from processes invoiced late — or never.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/casos#certificaciones" class="sect-cta-link" data-i18n="sect-case-link">See case →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="sect-card fade-up">
        <div class="sect-sector" data-i18n="sect2-sector">Perishables Logistics</div>
        <div>
          <div class="sect-before-tag" data-i18n="sect-before-tag">Today</div>
          <p class="sect-txt sect-txt-before" data-i18n="sect2-before">The coordinator works nights because trucks leave at 2am. Every incident gets resolved by phone. One late-delivery fine costs $4 million.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sect-divider"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="sect-after-tag" data-i18n="sect-after-tag">With 3GI</div>
          <p class="sect-txt sect-txt-after" data-i18n="sect2-after">An agent monitors the fleet, contacts drivers on incidents, and escalates only if there's no response. The coordinator sleeps. Zero fines per season.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/casos#logistica" class="sect-cta-link" data-i18n="sect-case-link">See case →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="sect-card fade-up">
        <div class="sect-sector" data-i18n="sect3-sector">Agricultural Export</div>
        <div>
          <div class="sect-before-tag" data-i18n="sect-before-tag">Today</div>
          <p class="sect-txt sect-txt-before" data-i18n="sect3-before">The field manager makes irrigation decisions by experience. One undetected water-stressed block can cost 30–40% of the lot's value in quality rejection.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sect-divider"></div>
